  "description": "The girl next door—who seemed like an angel and with whom he’d once promised to marry after falling in love at first sight—returns ten years later... as a massive man!?\n\nEugene Kim is a Korean-American living in a small U.S. town.\nHe reunites with his first love, Morgan Riley, who has moved back next door after a decade—only to find that Morgan has transformed into a huge, blond man.\nEugene tries to avoid him after realizing he had mistaken Morgan for a girl, but things don't go quite as planned.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/findmyangel), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/find_angel)",
